@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
hide footbox
title UC_EXT01 通知预约读者顺序图
control "归还或入库控制对象" as C
boundary NotifyBoundary as N
actor "外部通知服务" as G
C -> N : sendReadyNotices(noticeList)
loop 每个本次激活的预约单
 N -> N : 组装读者、书目、预约单号和可借提示
 N -> G : send(contact, message)
 G --> N : 成功或失败或超时
 alt 通知成功
  N -> N : 记录发送成功
 else 通知失败或超时
  N -> N : logFailure(slipId, reason)
  note right of N : 保留预约与馆藏状态\n供后续人工补发
 end
end
N --> C : 各条通知结果
note over C,N : 业务事务已提交；通知失败不回滚入库、归还或预约激活
@enduml
